  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional partnership between BMF, North-West University,         Stockholm School of Economics &amp; Diakonia on CSR in the mining sector  of SA, inter alia, to explore the role of mining corporations&apos; CSR    practices to (i) contribute to poverty alleviation initiatives,(ii)   promote local economic development (social entrepreneurship),and      (iii) protect the environment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutionell partnerskap mellan BMF, North-West University,         Stockholm School of Economics &amp; Diakonia  om f&#xf6;retagens sociala       ansvar i gruvsektorn i SA, bland annat f&#xf6;r att unders&#xf6;ka betydelsen   av gruvdriftf&#xf6;retagens CSR-metoder f&#xf6;r att (i) bidra till initiativ   fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning, (ii ) fr&#xe4;mja lokal ekonomisk utveckling         (socialt entrepren&#xf6;rskap), och (iii) skydda milj&#xf6;n.</narrative>
  </description>
